      "Model requests a structured action; your app executes it",
      "Open protocol so hosts talk to shared tool/resource servers",
      "Vendor-specific plugins/connectors inside one product",
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Primary job",
    cells: [
      "Let agents act (APIs, scripts, systems of record)",
      "Reuse the same tool implementations across clients",
      "Deep, polished integrations for that suite only",
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Portability",
    cells: [
      "Depends how you wire tools into each runtime",
      "High — write a server once, attach many MCP hosts",
      "Low — rewrites when you leave the vendor",
