  {
    label: "Security model",
    cells: [
      "Your runtime must validate args, auth, and scopes",
      "Server + host enforce policy; still not automatic IAM",
      "Usually strong admin/SSO if the suite owns identity",
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Best when",
    cells: [
      "Any real agent that must touch external systems",
