        note: "First-class tool calling; MCP support evolving alongside OpenAI’s agent stack.",
        href: "/tools/openai-agents-sdk/",
      },
      {
        name: "CrewAI, Mastra, Pydantic AI, LlamaIndex, Microsoft Agent Framework, Google ADK",
